  "_comment": "SMOKE ONLY — verifies SCCL v6 (Branch D) wiring on the real engine with 2 families x 4 tasks. Four learners cover the 2x2 factorial + control: 'sccl' (NOT in sccl_capprobe_learners / sccl_anchor_learners -> no cap probes manufactured, gate entries show checked_cap=0, anchor_pen=0 = isolation control), 'sccl_capens' (K=3 ensemble, no anchor -> vault must retain >1 distinct-source-skill cap_probe in some family and a gate must log checked_cap>1 once >=2 probes exist; anchor_pen=0), 'sccl_cap_anchor' (K=1 + anchor lambda=0.1 -> checked_cap matches newest-per-family, anchor_pen>0 on accepted updates), 'sccl_capens_anchor' (K=3 + anchor -> ensemble engaged AND anchor_pen>0). Confirms fail-closed checks C2 (ensemble engagement), C3 (anchor engagement), C4 (isolation) before the full ladder. Never used for results.",
